## STOP conditions

Stop if candidate integration is missing, excerpts drift without reconciliation, later receipt fixes already own the change, shared settlement/durable browser custody is unresolved, authoritative read semantics cannot distinguish absence from refusal, backend query work becomes necessary, two reasonable focused repair attempts fail, or a fix needs out-of-scope source. Do not simulate authority success or invent a working endpoint to finish.

